5; Lu 12:42; 1Co 4:2; 2Co 2:17; 1Ti 1:12 What.That is, when the dreamers declare their dreams, and the true prophets faithfully declare their message, the difference between them will be as evident as that between \"the chaff and the wheat.\"</p>\n<p>1Co 3:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-23-29","title":"Jeremiah 23:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>like as. 5:14; 20:9; Lu 24:32; Joh 6:63; Ac 2:3,37; 2Co 2:16; 10:4,5 Heb 4:12; Re 11:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-23-30","title":"Jeremiah 23:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>14:14,15; 44:11,29; Le 20:3; 26:17; De 18:20; 29:20; Ps 34:16 Eze 13:8,20; 15:7; 1Pe 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-23-31","title":"Jeremiah 23:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>use. or, smooth. Isa 30:10; Mic 2:11 He. 17; 2Ch 18:5,10-12,19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-23-32","title":"Jeremiah 23:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>to err. 16; 27:14-22; 28:15-17; 29:21-23,31; De 13:1-18; 18:20; Isa 3:12 Eze 13:7-18; Zec 13:2,3; Re 19:20 and by. Zep 3:4; 2Co 1:17 therefore. 22; 7:8; La 2:14; Mt 15:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-23-33","title":"Jeremiah 23:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>What. 17:15; 20:7,8; Isa 13:1; 14:28; Na 1:1; Hab 1:1; Mal 1:1 I. 39,40; 12:7; De 31:17,18; 32:19,20; 2Ch 15:2; Ps 78:59,60 Ho 9:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-23-34","title":"Jeremiah 23:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":23,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":23,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>punish. Heb. visit upon. 2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-j